  "created": "2026-10-21T02:20:38.987Z",
  "description": "An update to Component factory's krypton toolkit to support .NET Framework 4.7.2 - 4.8.1 and .NET 8 - 11. Krypton Docking for WinForms: Visual Studio-style dock, float, and auto-hide of pages. Built on Krypton Workspace and Navigator so docking areas share the same layout and theming model. This package supports all .NET Framework versions starting .NET Framework 4.6.2 - 4.8.1 and .NET 8 - 11. Also, all libraries are included targeting each specific framework version for performance purposes. To view all of the standard toolkit package latest version information, please visit: https://github.com/Krypton-Suite/Krypton-Toolkit-Suite-Version-Dashboard/blob/main/Documents/Modules/Standard/Krypton-Toolkit-Suite-Standard-Modules.md To find out what's new, please visit: https://github.com/Krypton-Suite/Standard-Toolkit/blob/alpha/Documents/Changelog/Changelog.md This package is for those who want to try out the latest cutting edge features before deployment.",
